('33333333-1008-4333-8333-333333333333','How Shoes Changed Street Style','Sneakers, flats, boots, and the outfit''s final verb.','https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/853848/853848-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4',null,60,'street style',array['shoes','street style'],array['Street Muse','Classic'],'street style shoe details vertical documentary sneakers flats boots','typography');

